COMP 2404 B2 - Assignment 4

Name: Mohamed Azab 101331588

Purpose: Simulate Timmy and Harold climbing out of a pit while snorcs
         move randomly and cause damage in collisions.

Header files: defs.h, Escape.h, Position.h, Pit.h, Participant.h,
              PartArray.h, Hero.h, Snorc.h

Source files: main.cc, Escape.cc, Position.cc, Pit.cc, Participant.cc,
              PartArray.cc, Hero.cc, Snorc.cc, random.cc

Other files: Makefile, README
Data files: None

Compilation (Ubuntu Linux with g++ C++11):
  make

To run the program:
  ./escape

There are no command-line arguments.
The program displays each step of the randomized simulation and ends
when both heroes have escaped or died.

To remove the executable and compiled object files:
  make clean
